WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.440
Despite all of the damage that it's caused,

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:06.000
the shutdown has been, you know, pretty damaging.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.360
I mean, it's not yet because it's early,

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:12.080
but it gets a little bit worse as it goes along.

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:14.600
And we'll be making cuts that will be permanent.

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:16.580
And we're only gonna cut Democrat programs.

00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:18.879
I hate to tell you. I guess that makes sense.

00:00:18.879 --> 00:00:21.280
But we're only cutting Democrat programs.

00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:25.639
We'll be cutting some very popular Democrat programs

00:00:25.639 --> 00:00:27.920
that aren't popular with Republicans, frankly,

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:29.040
because that's the way it works.

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:30.440
They wanted to do this,

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:32.720
so we'll give them a little taste of their own medicine.

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:34.439
But Chuck Schumer proclaimed this morning

00:00:34.439 --> 00:00:37.919
that every day gets better for them.

00:00:37.919 --> 00:00:41.080
No, every day, it's actually getting worse for them.

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:43.480
And they're having a rebellion in the Democrat Party.

